        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo FS-260, ANSI Strike Hole Frame Filler Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nANSI strike plate hole frame filler plate. Normally used on commercial metal frame doors to cover the frame hole when a <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device</b></a> is used on the door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-FS-260_size.gif?v=1704354690\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo FS-260 frame filler plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo FS-260 Filler Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .090\" (13 Gauge)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Primer or Chrome plated</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FS-260.pdf?v=1704262278\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo FS-260 Filler Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
